{"id": "i01", "raw_input": "我想在香港注册一家公司做电商，需要注册地址和公司秘书，另外想开个银行账户。", "expect_services": ["incorporation", "registered_address", "company_secretary", "bank_account_assist"], "expect_budget": false}
